# Shipped logo artwork must round-trip byte-exact.
#
# core.autocrlf is on for this repo, which would rewrite the SVG's line endings
# on checkout; `npm run logo -- --check` compares rendered bytes, so a converted
# SVG would look "drifted" even though the artwork is correct. The raster twins
# are binary. Never apply EOL conversion to anything under public/logo/.
public/logo/* -text
